---
name: counselors
description: Get parallel second opinions from multiple AI coding agents with the counselors CLI. Use when the user wants independent code review, architecture feedback, bug hunting, risk analysis, sanity checks on a plan or diff, or iterative multi-agent analysis across the current repository.
---

# Counselors

Use `counselors` to fan out a review prompt to multiple configured AI coding agents, then synthesize the results.

Treat `counselors` runs as long-running work. A dispatch commonly takes 10 to 20+ minutes. Prefer launching it, monitoring progress, and returning once results are available instead of blocking without updates.

## Workflow

### 1. Gather context

Parse the user request and identify the smallest useful review scope.

Collect:
- files explicitly mentioned by the user
- recent changes from `git diff HEAD` and `git diff --staged`
